{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While enjoying some tea and cookies with you teddy bear, you suddenly get shrunken down to the size of a mouse. How inconvenient having suddenly shrunken may be, you have much greater problem at hand: your teddy bear has been kidnapped!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 3d platformer you will have to test your skills and overcome many challenges along the way. You can use your hammer attack to defeat your enemies. Jump on walls to get to hard to reach places. And if walking is a bit too slow for you, you can easily dive across across the levels, just watch out you don't fall off.\u00a0<br><br>Explore the house and find secrets and levels. Find the candy pieces scattered through out the levels and unlock new areas to explore.\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Friends Forever!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412670/385c0b71a4a1811953afdfdaf05dc4186594887d.jpg"},{"name":"Play time has started!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412670/014e7f89ae231561b777c303120dac63f1e66ac0.jpg"},{"name":"Awesome skills!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412670/88fee809db15baea84b90aceebff198daa53077f.jpg"},{"name":"Sweet Revenge!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412670/3f0946c3ba53ebeaa7a118245ccc23524cdde9ab.jpg"},{"name":"Sweet Spot!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412670/b1044f04a41ce1fd5a94550faf4bcd2401a74c1d.jpg"},{"name":"Sweet Home!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412670/837292b381775be613772f0cfd4bf48dd930f2c3.jpg"},{"name":"Pocket change!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412670/4af1e7381c118429f65b5841385137c84934e119.jpg"},{"name":"Balance the books!","pa